{"id":"chatcmpl-c38fa5e5-afc2-41fb-97e5-b8b5acf97f6f","object":"chat.completion","created":1795229105,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a specialized-tool-first strategy for medical image interpretation: delegate modality-specific visual question answering to a domain expert model, then confirm with direct visual inspection. The key abstraction is lateralization reasoning—determining patient-side orientation (left vs. right) from radiological conventions rather than image-space position. Success hinges on asking the expert a targeted question that resolves both presence and location in one call.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a task requires interpreting a specialized data type (medical images, signals, legal text), route the core question to a domain-specific expert tool rather than reasoning from general knowledge.\",\n    \"Formulate expert-tool queries to resolve multiple sub-questions at once (presence AND location/side) to minimize round trips and ambiguity.\",\n    \"For lateralized findings, always map image-space position to patient-anatomical orientation using domain conventions before selecting an answer.\",\n    \"After obtaining a tool answer, perform a brief independent visual/structural confirmation to catch orientation or labeling errors.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging QA\": \"Ask the expert model a single compound question covering finding presence and anatomical side; then verify against radiological orientation conventions (patient's left = image right on PA views).\",\n    \"Specialized-domain multiple choice\": \"Identify the modality, delegate to the matching expert tool, and constrain the tool query to the exact discriminative dimension between options (e.g., side, presence/absence).\",\n    \"Binary localization tasks\": \"Reduce the decision to the single axis that separates the options (left vs. right), and confirm orientation mapping explicitly before answering.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm the expert tool's answer addresses both presence and the specific side/location distinguishing the options.\",\n    \"Verify patient-side orientation convention (e.g., PA view mirroring) before finalizing the letter choice.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":476,"total_tokens":871,"completion_tokens":395,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":476},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":395}}}